 i can't  release details of too much yet because  it's confidential but coming soon to a  screen near you  it's great when you can work with  artists and people around you who who  love what you do who support your cause  who are on their own path and rich is a  really talented  artist and photographer and and  filmmaker who is going to  change the lives of millions of people i  feel that and i know that and and i'm  excited to be able to  be able to look back and say i knew rich  when he was just getting started i knew  richard he was at the bottom and was  building his way up so rich thank you so  much for all your great help all your  support all the the the love you put  into your art and and for  your desire to  to help me and also to help have a  strong impact on this world  it means a lot to me and so for those of  you watching take two minutes today to  thank somebody who's had an impact on  your life write them a note make them a  video send them an email go visit them  and surprise them with a donut or a  coffee something just something to say  thank you because again you can't do  this alone you need the people around  you to help you out and saying thank you  and showing some gratitude is a great  way to make you feel better them feel  better and to help your business grow  believe  for those of you watching like the video  you want to see more just like this you  can subscribe to the channel to see more  thank you so much i'll see you soon  every week i share my best information  to help you fuel your business forward  in my newsletter check it out below  hi i'm jason j ross fonseca of  riseonline.com and i want to say evan  carmichael's newsletter is consistent  fun inspiring and it's the only  newsletter i prioritize and look forward  to period
 

